    <!-- HealthPermissionsRationaleActivity.kt -->
    <string name="more_health_rationale_title">Health data in Trailscape</string>
    <string name="more_health_rationale_intro_body">Trailscape reads health data only from Health Connect and never writes anything back. Everything is processed on this device only; there is no Trailscape server, and the developer has no access to your data.</string>
    <string name="more_health_rationale_workouts_body">Workouts, exercise routes, distance and calories: to import the rides from your watch.</string>
    <string name="more_health_rationale_heart_rate_body">Heart rate: for the heart-rate figures of your rides and — if your watch doesn’t provide a resting heart rate — for a resting heart rate derived from your overnight heart rate.</string>
    <string name="more_health_rationale_recovery_body">Resting heart rate, HRV, sleep and VO₂max: for calculating recovery and form (readiness, training recommendation).</string>
    <string name="more_health_rationale_history_body">History older than 30 days (optional): so the baselines for resting heart rate and HRV don’t take weeks to settle, and the first import can bring in your rides from the last 12 months once.</string>
    <string name="more_health_rationale_sync_body">The data only leaves your device if you have set up the optional sync with your own server yourself.</string>
    <string name="more_health_rationale_privacy_action">Full privacy policy</string>

